                                "sense_id": "bec9b5de-0c92-3a7e-ab5c-a24fa6cdda45",
                                "text": "Hee sett Promethius, on a merrye pynn, / Whoe dranke soe devillishly, that there he gott / A terrible heartburninge, […]"
                            }
                        ]
